</td>
                <td style="width: 160.484px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Pathophysiology</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 66.5156px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Anterior Chamber</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 167px; height: 48px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Key Features</bold></p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 62px;">
                <td style="width: 10px; height: 62px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Phacolytic</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 169px; height: 62px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hypermature cataract leaks proteins</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 160.484px; height: 62px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Macrophage-mediated trabecular meshwork (TM)&#x000a0;obstruction</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 66.5156px; height: 62px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Deep</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 167px; height: 62px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Floating proteinaceous material, high flare</p>
</td>
              </tr>
